    "description": "A collection of two vintage tobacco smoking pipes and one separate stem. These pieces feature distinct finishes and classic shapes, suitable for collectors or enthusiasts of traditional smoking accessories.\nLot includes one red speckled finish pipe with a metal band and black stem.\nLot includes one brown wood grain finish pipe with a brass-colored band and black stem.\nIncludes one additional yellow-toned stem.\nBoth pipes show signs of previous use in the bowls.\nCondition:\nThese are pre-owned items in used condition. The bowls show carbon buildup from previous use. The stems show minor surface wear and discoloration consistent with age and handling. Please see photos for details.\nDisclaimer: Please note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested. All items are not Authenticated. Unless otherwise notated all autographed items have not been authenticated by a third party. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nPlease read our policies below before placing your bid\nThank you for bidding on an item from Goodwill Serving Southern Los Angeles County. 88 cents from every dollar raised goes to funding our mission to help people in our community with barriers to employment.\nPlease see images for further detail and please ask any questions you may have\nbefore\nmaking a bid.\nWhen purchasing a pick-up only item, you have 10 days to pick up after payment, after which, your item will be donated back to Goodwill with no refund given.\nIf Approved for return, Refunds will not be given on shipping and handling charges.\nNote: Any extra props (i.e., stands, mannequins, shoe horns etc.) are not part of the auction and are for presentation purposes only.\nWe appreciate your support.\nGoodwill SOLAC",
