    "description": "Ornate Double Inkwell Desk Stand\nBrass-Tone Metal and Glass Inkstand\nRococo Revival Style, Vintage\nThis ornate desk stand features an elaborate Rococo Revival design with cast acanthus scrollwork, floral motifs, a central scalloped shell dish, and an integrated pen trough. The set includes two square clear glass inkwells with molded spiral swirl patterning and matching cast metal domed lids, offering elegant vintage desktop display.\nCast metal construction with aged brass-tone finish\nTwo removable spiral swirl glass inkwells with metal lids\nRococo Revival styling with acanthus scrolls and shell motif\nMeasures approximately 12\" long x 7.5\" wide x 4\" high\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. Cast metal stand is structurally sound and sits level, showing natural surface patina. Both glass inkwells are intact with clear glass and no visible chips or cracks. Matching lids fit cleanly. Underside shows expected casting texture with no maker marks.",
